  "description": "Control library for an Asterisk PBX running next to an application (Octopark parking columns and servers). Declarative configuration package (PJSIP extensions for Fanvil PA2S / X3SP, Yealink T30P and WebRTC browser phones, ring groups, intercom auto-answer, hotlines, SIP trunks, outbound routes) rendered to pjsip.conf / extensions.conf / manager.conf / rtp.conf / http.conf, idempotent apply with plan (dry run), package installation and service control on the host, AMI client (status, endpoints, contacts, channels, originate, hangup, reload, CLI commands) and phone setup sheets.",
